  "description": "HackDays 2.0 A One-Day Hackathon | Theme: Best Use Of Google Gemini API About The Event: Hack Days 2.0 is a one-day hackathon where teams build innovative solutions using the Google Gemini API. Selected teams will compete offline for a final round of judging, prizes, and recognition. Eligibility: Open to students from all colleges/universities. Team size: 2–4 members per team. Free registration — no participation fee. Event Format & Process: Registration & Idea Submission: Register your team on Unstop and submit a PPT explaining your proposed solution using the Google Gemini API. Shortlisting: Based on the submitted PPTs, selected teams will be announced for the offline final round. Offline Hackathon: Shortlisted teams build their solution live at the venue on the event day. Judging & Results: Teams present their final solution to judges in a table-to-table format, followed by prize distribution. Hackathon Day (Offline): Date: 26 Sep 2026 (Saturday). Venue: GCET, Greater Noida. Prizes & Recognition: Top 3 Teams: Certificates + prize pool. All Other Participating Teams: E-certificate via Unstop.",
