    "details": "<p><strong>HackDays 2.0</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A One-Day Hackathon | Theme: Best Use Of Google Gemini API</strong></p>\n<p><strong>About The Event:</strong></p>\n<p>Hack Days 2.0 is a one-day hackathon where teams build innovative solutions using the Google Gemini API. Selected teams will compete offline for a final round of judging, prizes, and recognition.</p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to students from all colleges/universities.</li>\n<li>Team size: 2&ndash;4 members per team.</li>\n<li>Free registration &mdash; no participation fee.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Event Format &amp; Process:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Registration &amp; Idea Submission:</strong> Register your team on Unstop and submit a PPT explaining your proposed solution using the Google Gemini API.</li>\n<li><strong>Shortlisting:</strong> Based on the submitted PPTs, selected teams will be announced for the offline final round.</li>\n<li><strong>Offline Hackathon:</strong> Shortlisted teams build their solution live at the venue on the event day.</li>\n<li><strong>Judging &amp; Results:</strong> Teams present their final solution to judges in a table-to-table format, followed by prize distribution.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Hackathon Day (Offline):</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Date:</strong> 26 Sep 2026 (Saturday).</li>\n<li><strong>Venue:</strong> GCET, Greater Noida.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Prizes &amp; Recognition:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Top 3 Teams:</strong> Certificates + prize pool.</li>\n<li><strong>All Other Participating Teams:</strong> E-certificate via Unstop.</li>\n</ul>",
